{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895110/extras/29b71c53f2fb1cf3c939a58fe16347d3.avif?t=1765897309\" width=616 height=467 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity has shattered. A remedy engineered to end hunger came at a devastating cost, twisting people into feral Dusters \u2014 ravenous addicts ruled by primal instinct. Ten years later, a mother and daughter wander in the ruins of civilization, clinging to a fragile hope for a better future. But their journey draws the gaze of an ominous preacher and his hollow-eyed flock. What hunts Katherine and Ava isn\u2019t a cult \u2014 it\u2019s something beyond reason: an ancient hunger that sees humans as fertile soil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895110/extras/d7370293c4f66dbaf3501c17fea8d64d.poster.avif?t=1765897309\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895110/extras/d7370293c4f66dbaf3501c17fea8d64d.webm?t=1765897309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895110/extras/d7370293c4f66dbaf3501c17fea8d64d.mp4?t=1765897309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a story-driven survival-horror adventure inspired by classics like Resident Evil and Silent Hill. Claw your way through decaying streets, bloodthirsty Dusters, locked rooms, and forgotten corridors \u2014 where every door could mean salvation\u2026 or your end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep Ava alive \u2014 no matter what. You can lose the world. You can\u2019t lose her. Every step pulls you deeper into a place that wants you broken. No one will save you. But you can fight. You can run. And you can still try to reach Sanctuary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3895110?t=1765897309","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895110/8c29114160975d5ab1321dad3505eaf8d27a77ab/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1765897309","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895110/13bdc607da9dc7d698c50d6e738509efc06270c1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765897309","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895110/13bdc607da9dc7d698c50d6e738509efc06270c1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765897309","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Frequent Violence or Gore, General Mature Content."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895110/extras/29b71c53f2fb1cf3c939a58fe16347d3.avif?t=1765897309\" width=616 height=467 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity has shattered. A remedy engineered to end hunger came at a devastating cost, twisting people into feral Dusters \u2014 ravenous addicts ruled by primal instinct. Ten years later, a mother and daughter wander in the ruins of civilization, clinging to a fragile hope for a better future. But their journey draws the gaze of an ominous preacher and his hollow-eyed flock. What hunts Katherine and Ava isn\u2019t a cult \u2014 it\u2019s something beyond reason: an ancient hunger that sees humans as fertile soil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895110/extras/d7370293c4f66dbaf3501c17fea8d64d.poster.avif?t=1765897309\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895110/extras/d7370293c4f66dbaf3501c17fea8d64d.webm?t=1765897309\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895110/extras/d7370293c4f66dbaf3501c17fea8d64d.mp4?t=1765897309\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a story-driven survival-horror adventure inspired by classics like Resident Evil and Silent Hill. Claw your way through decaying streets, bloodthirsty Dusters, locked rooms, and forgotten corridors \u2014 where every door could mean salvation\u2026 or your end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep Ava alive \u2014 no matter what. You can lose the world. You can\u2019t lose her. Every step pulls you deeper into a place that wants you broken. No one will save you. But you can fight. You can run. And you can still try to reach Sanctuary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Painted Black Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3895110/8b2f5aaa7e2a06ff809f055a399d03025d9a7adb/header.jpg?t=1765897309","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3895110/2014587892/eabf286531445b098bbe672ab83318b392f295f1/1754731121/dash_av1.m